stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Issued
  Issued --> Verified: signature and TTL valid
  Issued --> Expired: block/time TTL exceeded
  Issued --> Rejected: signature mismatch or hash mismatch
  Verified --> Redeemed: confirm endpoint consumes token
  Verified --> ReplayRejected: reused hash or redeemed nonce
  Redeemed --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  ReplayRejected --> [*]
